original file, what was taken from it and how it was changed.

Samsung Keyboard (patches/src/main/kotlin/app/template/patches/samsungkeyboard,
patches/src/main/kotlin/app/template/patches/shared/samsung,
patches/src/main/kotlin/app/template/patches/shared/NewerJavaCalls.kt and
